sequenceDiagram
 participant U as Listen button
 participant F as startListening
 participant B as Browser APIs
 U->>F: click
 F->>U: disable
 F->>F: requesting permission; renderDebug(0)
 F->>B: getUserMedia audio=true
 B-->>F: stream
 F->>B: AudioContext; await resume
 F->>B: analyser fftSize=2048; connect source
 F->>F: allocate buffer; listening; setInterval 100 ms
 F->>U: Listening; remains disabled
 Note over F,B: Catch reports error name and enables retry
 Note over F,B: No stop-listening cleanup path
